<title>USA: Vans Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Vans Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter, Fiscal Year 1997</p>
<p>		    (In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    August 31,August 26,</p>
<p>							   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net sales				    $    43,956 $    28,404</p>
<p> Cost of goods				     26,405	18,289</p>
<p> Gross margin					17,551	10,115</p>
<p>Expenses:</p>
<p> Selling &amp; Distribution			   7,176	 6,190</p>
<p> Marketing, advertising and promotion	 3,946	 1,400</p>
<p> General &amp; administrative			 1,534	 1,250</p>
<p> Other income (a)				   (438)	 (427)</p>
